<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 3.330 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 3.330 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 3.330 billion pesos in the secondary market on Thursday through three credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>1.165 bln  13 days</p>
<p>1.165 bln  12 days</p>
<p>1.000 bln   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
